ent. She expressed her anticipation to see the project move forward.\\par\r\n\\par\r\nMayor Gallego thanked voters for supporting the general obligation bonds that made this and other improvements possible.\\par\r\n}\r\n","EventItemActionId":363,"EventItemActionName":"adopted","EventItemActionText":"A motion was made by Vice Mayor Hodge Washington, seconded by Councilwoman O'Brien, that this item be adopted. The motion carried by the following vote:","EventItemPassedFlag":1,"EventItemPassedFlagName":"Pass","EventItemRollCallFlag":0,"EventItemFlagExtra":0,"EventItemTitle":"Cactus Park Precinct - Architectural Services - PD00000077 (General Obligation Bond) (Ordinance S-53072) - District 1","EventItemTally":null,"EventItemAccelaRecordId":null,"EventItemConsent":0,"EventItemMoverId":2022,"EventItemMover":"Kesha Hodge Washington","EventItemSeconderId":1772,"EventItemSeconder":"Ann O'Brien","EventItemMatterId":35187,"EventItemMatterGuid":"F93545D7-559F-45CB-BEA9-891FA355D1A7","EventItemMatterFile":"26-1152","EventItemMatterName":null,"EventItemMatterType":"Ordinance-S","EventItemMatterStatus":"Adopted","EventItemMatterAttachments":[]},{"EventItemId":64873,"EventItemGuid":"6CE9355C-539A-4241-A6A7-1D73FC7EF91D","EventItemLastModifiedUtc":"2026-07-15T19:30:46.993","EventItemRowVersion":"AAAAAASVFl8=","EventItemEventId":2651,"EventItemAgendaSequence":91,"EventItemMinutesSequence":87,"EventItemAgendaNumber":"79","EventItemVideo":null,"EventItemVideoIndex":null,"EventItemVersion":"1","EventItemAgendaNote":null,"EventItemMinutesNote":null,"EventItemActionId":363,"EventItemActionName":"adopted","EventItemActionText":"This item was adopted.","EventItemPassedFlag":1,"EventItemPassedFlagName":"Pass","EventItemRollCallFlag":0,"EventItemFlagExtra":null,"EventItemTitle":"Remove/Replace Zoning District - 9th Avenue and Alameda Road - Annexation 560 - Approximately 700 Feet West of the Northwest Corner of 9th Avenue and Alameda Road (Ordinance G-7526) - District 1","EventItemTally":null